### Goal Model Tables

#### **Goals Table**

| Name       | Title                     | Text                                                                 | Runtime                          | Goal Type | Relation |
|------------|---------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1         | Fulfill Resource Request  | A robot must collect resources from storage and deliver them to the requesting agent. | `;` (sequential)                | Perform   | AND      |
| G2         | Collection Phase          | The robot must go to the storage, request resources, and wait until retrieved. | `FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2)`          | Perform   | AND      |
| G3         | Delivery Phase            | The robot must deliver all collected resources to the specified location.        | `FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2)`          | Perform   | AND      |
| G2.1       | Collect Resources at Storage | The robot collects resources from a specific storage.                        | `;` (sequential)                | Perform   | AND      |
| G2.2       | Battery Low Fallback      | If battery is 10% during collection, return to recharging station and reassign. | `;` (sequential)                | Perform   | OR       |
| G3.1       | Deliver Resources         | The robot delivers all resources to the requesting agent's location.           | `;` (sequential)                | Perform   | AND      |
| G3.2       | Battery Low in Delivery   | If battery is 30% during delivery, return to checkpoint and reassign.          | `FALLBACK(G3.2.1, G3.2.2)`     | Perform   | OR       |
| G3.2.1     | Return to Checkpoint      | The robot returns to a checkpoint and assigns the remaining task to another robot. | `;` (sequential)                | Perform   | AND      |
| G3.2.2     | Trigger Alert             | If returning to checkpoint fails, trigger an alert and report to the sector manager. | `-` (leaf)                     | Perform   | OR       |

