### **Logical Relationships**

- **G1 -> G2, G3 [AND][;]**
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2 [OR][FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2)]**
- **G2.1 -> AT1, AT2, AT3 [AND][;]**
- **G2.2 -> AT4, AT5 [AND][;]**
- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2 [OR][FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2)]**
- **G3.1 -> AT6 [AND][;]**
- **G3.2 -> G3.2.1, G3.2.2 [OR][FALLBACK(G3.2.1, G3.2.2)]**
- **G3.2.1 -> AT7, AT8 [AND][;]**
- **G3.2.2 -> AT9, AT10 [AND][;]**

